// Regression: more buffers than a byte can index.
// 30 objects x 10 member variables = 300+ buffers. Every value-carrying decl
// takes a buffer -- per object instance -- so object count multiplies fast.
// csp_view_t.buf used to be uint8_t: buffer id 300 wrapped to 44 and the leaf
// silently read another object's value (m0.A came back as 4, not 1). buf is now
// as wide as the nbuf counter that produces it, so it cannot truncate.
#module M
  #variable A integer = 1
  #variable B integer = 2
  #variable C integer = 3
  #variable D integer = 4
  #variable E integer = 5
  #variable F integer = 6
  #variable G integer = 7
  #variable H integer = 8
  #variable I integer = 9
  #variable J integer = 10
#end

#M m0
#M m1
#M m2
#M m3
#M m4
#M m5
#M m6
#M m7
#M m8
#M m9
#M m10
#M m11
